{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.S5bbClosure.index_evaluates_to_c4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.S5bbClosure.index_evaluates_to_c4","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/S5bbGeometricIndex.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Assumed (open hypothesis, not proved): the equivariant index is posited\nto equal `4143/90` — a fit-tier value; see the class docstring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.S5bbClosure.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.S5bbClosure.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/S5bbGeometricIndex.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.S5bbClosure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.S5bbClosure","kind":"class","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/S5bbGeometricIndex.lean#L36-L56","doc":"**Conditional class — an open hypothesis, not a derivation.** Carries the\nassumption that the equivariant index of the colour Reeb field against the\nWenzl weights equals `4143/90`, the value the term-6 Habiro residue `c₄` would\ntake for the 4-loop `u⁴` closure.\n\n`4143/90` is **fit-tier**: it has no derivation trail (it occurs on a single\nproducer line and nothing in the corpus computes it), the cited U(1)\ncolour-Reeb-index route is **refuted**, and it is a *worse* fit than the bare\ninteger `46`. See\n`docs/audits/2026-07-04-c4-mu-p-tension-pin-dependence.md` §\"mislabeled\nnumerology\" and `docs/audits/2026-06-16-s5so3-reeb-resonance-probe-negative.md`.\nThe geometric derivation that would *discharge* this hypothesis (the contact\nequivariant index on the s5bb 5-manifold) is obstructed (Wu-manifold) and\nowner-gated. Per AGENTS.md §\"Axiomatization is NOT a Proof\": an instance of\nthis class *assumes* `c₄`, it does not derive it.\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.EquivariantIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.EquivariantIndex","kind":"opaque","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/S5bbGeometricIndex.lean#L33-L34","doc":"The equivariant index evaluated against the Ocneanu weights via Atiyah-Bott localization. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.WenzlWeights","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.WenzlWeights","kind":"opaque","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/S5bbGeometricIndex.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.VectorField","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.VectorField","kind":"opaque","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/S5bbGeometricIndex.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.Manifold5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S5bbGeometricIndex.Manifold5","kind":"opaque","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/S5bbGeometricIndex.lean#L23-L24","doc":"Abstract types for the 5-manifold and vector fields to serve as conditional hooks. ","signatureChunk":0}]}